        <mxCell id="title" value="&lt;b&gt;ProcessMind — Enterprise AI Process Mining &amp;amp; BPMN Automation: System Architecture&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#666666&quot;&gt;Multi-agent pipeline: unstructured SOPs / event logs in → validated BPMN 2.0, bottleneck findings and As-Is/To-Be reports out.&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=18;" vertex="1" parent="1">
